{"id": "34399", "title": "爱情帖", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34399.htm", "intro": "美丽的白宛司小姐有许多追求者，为了应付那些推不掉的约会，她把那些追求者的名字写在贴子上，每天像抽签一样，抽中谁就跟谁约会：这就是爱情贴的由来。然而造化弄人，姻缘天定，最后与她共谐连理的，竟不是爱情贴中人……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34399", "chapters": [{"title": "第1节", "file": "2184673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节", "file": "2184674.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节", "file": "2184675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节", "file": "2184676.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节", "file": "2184677.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节", "file": "2184678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节", "file": "2184679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节", "file": "2184680.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节", "file": "2184681.html", "available": false}]}